  <p id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghui-daughter-and-court-wedding:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghui-daughter-and-court-wedding:p001:m0000" ref="1tc_q18_x7v_B">繢</persName><persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghui-daughter-and-court-wedding:p001:m0001" ref="1tc_q18_x7v_BB">女</persName>適安陸王<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghui-daughter-and-court-wedding:p001:m0006" ref="kix_r92_2ed_A">子敬</persName>，世祖寵子。永明三年，納妃，脩外舅<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghui-daughter-and-court-wedding:p001:m0025" ref="mke_sq6_skq">姑</persName>之敬。世祖遣文惠太子相隨往<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghui-daughter-and-court-wedding:p001:m0039" ref="1tc_q18_x7v_B">繢</persName>家置酒設樂，公卿皆冠冕而至，當世榮之。</p>
</text>
